# CodeGraph

This project uses **CodeGraph** (`@colbymchenry/codegraph`), not Graphify.

- Index lives in `.codegraph/`
- Prefer CodeGraph MCP tools (`codegraph_explore`, `codegraph_context`, callers/callees/impact) before broad Grep/Glob sweeps
- After adding or renaming modules/entities, run `codegraph sync`
- CLI equivalents: `codegraph query`, `codegraph explore`, `codegraph impact`, `codegraph status`

Do not install or invoke Graphify in this repository.
